Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||09-09-1999||01:39 AM||||I was just playing around with some images tonight, and thought I'd make something Fiero-related. I took an image of a computer with a CD in the tray, and put a Fiero on it. It's Cliff's Fiero, as I started out to try and make a graphic for the Forum.. not sure if I can get a useful Forum graphic out of this or not, but here it is.. comments?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierocd.jpg"> ||||reg||
Z||000001||lowCG||09-09-1999||02:48 AM||||It's interesting,but,I think the hole in the middle could represent something less than good,symbolically,anyways.Maybe if it were to be a 3D image,sitting on top of the CD,with the words "Fiero Forum" on the CD,maybe?Wait a minute,we don't have CD's here,just screens driven by code.<BR>Spent a couple of years in art school staring at corporate identities,ads,it's a great start I'd say,in my opinion.<BR>||||reg||
Z||000002||DaRkLoRD||09-09-1999||02:52 AM||||I tried it without the hole, but it didn't look like a CD. But I see what you mean about the symbolic meaning of a hole in the car.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Like I said, I was just messing around with some graphics. I'll see what else I can come up with.||||reg||
